<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese militia boats are expanding battlefield preparation in the western Pacific while the Chinese coast guard monitors Philippine resupply missions to the grounded BRP Sierra Madre at Ayungin Shoal. The Philippine Coast Guard rescued 20 people off Basilan and opened an upgraded station on Pag-asa Island, but two Coast Guard personnel were killed in a shooting in Cotabato City. Taiwan is offering cooperation to protect undersea cables, and an ex-NSA urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOTXI3SFRVTXFrMURWSExwd01uY0lFUVZ4M3J2amc4XzE3QVBidmZZOU9qVUFkQ3c3U1RSMG8wOTZ1M1M5Q1RXM0RwUzN5MkpILTEwQ3hjdjlQRU1jWVUyb1JXT3BFdzRWdFdyZzcxLXNoUk5hWDlTY2I3LWRpYkpZUkg1bmJtamZRYnMtdTJvOG5VX21RQ05fRkJCY082Ql90ME1zYllHZ1MyS211WWdDd2l3WFJ0dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNS1g4ME92NnRXek9tZFVvSE5YM1I2UUxKbHRBZjJUQzVpbkxnMFNybkwydVVuVVZsQWRfOVI2SEQyY0RMN2NLNFVqX0g0aXZzQjNDdzdSSjgzLUNZZWlsSzlzbFE3ZFV1bTdubmtUYl9RcnZEZXJxNnRCUjZoeG9IdTVsWWVldGFiczJmanh5QWY5Skt4UjduUA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNZ0JqRjc0Z0hGb2VQTHo3UTNrS2FpV2lKRG9iWWJpNXdweE5VWGN3TnhfYWtIOUxOTHdTaFU4QVVMUHZWbHp6Qlh2S0hJdjYzRjJYRGoxSEVvN1lQak1NNl9zbEd6YWZXZ0hyaUxjUkFEWEZLaEFya05MVE1kMDQtOXdBXzZIN2pkRWRDdElGeU9CdDdyVW5uanVzZEVCRGN4cUZEb3RvRVZHTjRFYXV3Rzd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;TimesLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOTm9ucmxjeWpsdHJ0bi1QUWNYWGotdlp2dVQ2WTFuR2Ffb1RFSEt4QWdSUWJYdHNTOUxZUTB6WEtxTEFhUlI2bmJJcU04c2pLZzl5Qy1Fa0hmcXd3UUFLbUVzV1ZIRTdmMzJ1RFo4WWo3V1BrenF1R3RPaXBwaXpLZWhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Marine Link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 